# R - Import a host file into cpmsim

```text
R host-file [CP/M-filespec]
```

## Import a file

```text
R "My assembly source.asm" D0:SOURCE.ASM
```

Put the host file in the emulator's working directory. Quote spaces and
preserve host filename case. Provide an explicit 8.3 destination when
the host name is long. The example writes to user 0 on D.

## Transfer back

Use [W](W.HLP) to export the edited copy. R and W operate on individual
files on cpmsim. For a whole disk image, use [MOUNT](MOUNT.HLP).
